start: mr
R1: {3ch=tr 2tr 2ch 3tr 2ch 3tr 2ch 3tr 2ch}@ring ss@top
R2: ss@corner 3ch=tr {2tr ch}@same {3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@corner {3tr 2ch}@corner {3tr ch}@same {3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@corner {3tr 2ch}@corner ss@top
R3: ss@corner 3ch=tr {2tr ch}@same [{3tr ch}@sp {3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@corner {3tr ch}@sp {3tr 2ch}@corner {3tr ch}@same]x1 {3tr ch}@sp {3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@corner {3tr ch}@sp {3tr 2ch}@corner ss@top
R4: ss@corner 3ch=tr {3tr ch}@corner [[{3tr ch}@sp]x2 {3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@corner [{3tr ch}@sp]x2 {3tr 2ch}@corner {3tr ch}@same]x1 [{3tr ch}@sp]x2 {3tr 2ch 3tr ch}@corner [{3tr ch}@sp]x2 {3tr 2ch}@corner ss@top # literal "Ch3, (3tr, ch1)": first group has 4 tr
